-in budgeted ticks', 'justification_owner': 'gameplay-architect'}\n{'id': 'L03', 'pattern': 'Game-thread / render-thread dichotomy', 'detection': 'named long-lived render thread', 'default_stance': 'Render work as tasks; dedicated threads only by ADR', 'justification_owner': 'gpu-platform-architect'}\n{'id': 'L04', 'pattern': 'Main-thread-only engine APIs', 'detection': 'UI, scripting or platform callbacks require the OS main thread', 'default_stance': 'PAL isolates OS-thread-bound APIs behind queues', 'justification_owner': 'platform-architect'}\n{'id': 'L05', 'pattern': 'Pervasive inheritance object hierarchies', 'detection': 'Actor→Pawn→Character chains', 'default_stance': 'Composition of components/systems + services', 'justification_owner': 'entity-object-model'}\n{'id': 'L06', 'pattern': 'Possession / controller-pawn model by habit', 'detection': 'universal possession concept', 'default_stance': 'Control binding as data, chosen per game by ADR', 'justification_owner': 'gameplay-architect'}\n{'id': 'L07', 'pattern': 'Universal scene graph', 'detection': 'one tree holds the world', 'default_stance': 'Partitioned data-oriented world; hierarchy only for attachment', 'justification_owner': 'world-architect'}\n{'id': 'L08', 'pattern': 'Hidden globals & singletons', 'detection': 'static instances initialized implicitly', 'default_stance': 'Service registry + init graph', 'justification_owner': 'core-runtime-architect'}\n{'id': 'L09', 'pattern': 'Process-global mutable cvars read anywhere', 'detection': 'cvar reads inside parallel tasks', 'default_stance': 'Immutable config snapshots latched at sync points', 'justification_owner': 'core-runtime-architect'}\n{'id': 'L10', 'pattern': 'Hot-path virtual dispatch across contracts', 'detection': 'virtual call per draw/body/query', 'default_stance': 'Batch-granular interfaces; binding at build/load time', 'justification_owner': 'engine-architect'}\n{'id': 'L11', 'pattern': 'Coarse locks & global renderer sync', 'detection': 'mutex around a subsystem; renderer-wide flush', 'default_stance': 'Declared access, channels, lock-free where justified', 'justification_owner': 'concurrency-primitives'}\n{'id': 'L12', 'pattern': 'Draw-call-centric CPU submission on capable tiers', 'detection': 'one CPU draw per object on desktop/console', 'default_stance': 'GPU-driven on capable tiers; CPU-batched on TBDR/lite3d by ADR', 'justification_owner': 'render-architect'}\n{'id': 'L13', 'pattern': 'DX11/OpenGL binding & sync assumptions', 'detection': 'slot binding, immediate context, driver-managed hazards', 'default_stance': 'Binding tiers + render-graph-derived barriers', 'justification_owner': 'rhi-core'}\n{'id': 'L14', 'pattern': 'Per-object render proxy mirror', 'detection': 'proxy objects created/synced per object per frame', 'default_stance': 'Change-tracked delta extraction, O(changes)', 'justification_owner': 'render-architect'}\n{'id': 'L15', 'pattern': 'Frame-tied resource lifetimes', 'detection': 'resources freed at end of frame/level', 'default_stance': 'Explicit lifetimes + retirement keyed to completion tokens', 'justification_owner': 'resource-streaming-architect'}\n{'id': 'L16', 'pattern': 'Synchronous IO / blocking loads', 'detection': 'file read on a frame-critical thread', 'default_stance': 'Async staged pipeline with deadlines', 'justification_owner': 'async-io-storage'}\n{'id': 'L17', 'pattern': 'Page-fault-driven streaming', 'detection': 'mmap reads on latency-critical workers', 'default_stance': 'Explicit IO requests; mmap only prefetched/tool-side', 'justification_owner': 'async-io-storage'}\n{'id': 'L18', 'pattern': 'Level-as-a-file loading', 'detection': 'whole level loaded before play', 'default_stance': 'Cell streaming with budgeted activation', 'justification_owner': 'world-architect'}\n{'id': 'L19', 'pattern': 'Immediate synchronous observer callbacks across subsystems', 'detection': \"callbacks invoked on the producer's thread mid-update\", 'default_stance': 'Deferred batc